<title>JAPAN: Japan Sept zinc imports off 54.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Sept zinc imports off 54.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined zinc imports in September totalled 2,414 tonnes, off 54.1 percent from 5,255 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, according to Ministry of Finance data released on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			Sept 96    Aug 96     Sept 95</p>
<p> Total		 2,414     3,007	 5,255</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> China		   593     1,833	 2,904</p>
<p>Refined zinc imports in the first nine months of 1996 totalled 121,417 tonnes, up 26.4 percent from 96,038 tonnes in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk (81-3 3432 6179)</p>
</text>
